{"run_id": "run_ec51abb633ed", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s01_course_notify_accept", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，请讲。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们将在课程发布页面新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原发布流程不变。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，那之前我们用的是哪种？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "之前后台统一配置的是低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "知道，那这两个有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些，具体以页面配置和合同为准。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "明白了。那发布流程会变吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程不变，只是新增选项，您可以根据课程场景选择。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好的。我们通过Web控制台发布课程，怎么配置低延迟直播？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "在发布页面选择直播类型时，选“低延迟直播”即可。如果看不到选项，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认权限。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我回头看看。还有其他要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，请关注同步提示。您还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "notified", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_ec51abb633ed", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s02_course_not_aware", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们直播发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原发布流程不变。您之前知道这个变化吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "不知道啊，之前我们发布课程时好像只有一个直播选项，怎么回事？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "之前后台统一配置的是低延迟链路，所以您可能没注意到。现在您可以根据课程场景选择：标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟1-2秒，互动更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那低延迟直播是不是更贵？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播链路保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播，具体以页面配置和合同约定为准。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统还是SaaS系统发布课程？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们用的是Web控制台。但我现在没看到低延迟直播的选项啊。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "可能是后台配置尚未完成，您稍后刷新页面看看，如果还是没有，可以联系平台确认权限。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，请关注同步提示。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "没有了，感谢您的接听，祝您工作顺利！"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "谢谢，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "informed", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_ec51abb633ed", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s03_course_compare_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，请讲。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们将在课程发布页面新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道。那这两个选项有什么区别？成本上有什么差异？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播，具体以页面配置和合同约定为准。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那低延迟直播具体贵多少？有没有大概的幅度？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "这个没有固定幅度，因为涉及带宽、转码等资源消耗，建议您查看页面配置时的价格提示，或参考合同条款。我们无法随意承诺优惠。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好吧，那发布流程会变吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程不变，只是在发布页面新增两个直播类型选项，您可按课程场景选择。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "明白了。那我现在通过Web控制台发布课程，在哪里配置低延迟直播？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "在发布页面的直播类型下拉菜单中，选择“低延迟直播”即可。如果看不到该选项，可能是后台配置尚未完成，可稍后刷新或联系平台确认权限。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我稍后试试。还有其他需要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，请关注同步提示。另外，如果您的课程需要实时互动，建议选择低延迟直播。"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，没有其他问题了。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "感谢您的接听，祝您工作顺利！再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
